WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.118 --> 00:00:05.118
(audience cheering)
(mellow music)

00:00:14.279 --> 00:00:19.279
♪ Came in from a rainy
Thursday on the avenue ♪

00:00:21.257 --> 00:00:26.257
♪ Thought I heard you talking softly ♪

00:00:26.764 --> 00:00:28.434
♪ Mm ♪

00:00:28.434 --> 00:00:33.434
♪ I turned on the lights,
the TV, and the radio ♪

00:00:34.882 --> 00:00:39.882
♪ Still I can't escape the ghost of you ♪

00:00:41.956 --> 00:00:45.224
♪ What has happened to it all ♪

00:00:45.224 --> 00:00:48.585
♪ Crazy, some would say ♪

00:00:48.585 --> 00:00:53.585
♪ Where is the life that I recognize ♪

00:00:54.736 --> 00:00:56.316
♪ Gone away ♪

00:00:56.316 --> 00:00:59.905
♪ But I won't cry for yesterday ♪

00:00:59.905 --> 00:01:03.156
♪ There's an ordinary world ♪

00:01:03.156 --> 00:01:08.156
♪ Somehow I have to find ♪

00:01:09.825 --> 00:01:13.362
♪ And as I try to make my way ♪

00:01:13.362 --> 00:01:16.785
♪ To the ordinary world ♪

00:01:16.785 --> 00:01:21.785
♪ I will learn to survive ♪

00:01:22.174 --> 00:01:27.174
♪ Every one ♪

00:01:28.966 --> 00:01:33.966
♪ Is my world ♪

00:01:35.667 --> 00:01:38.000
♪ Every one ♪

00:01:42.071 --> 00:01:45.902
(audience applauding and cheering)

